<p t="839279" d="7920" w="1"><s ac="0">joined by Pauliey&#39;s father, Mark. And
Mark, if you would please come up and</s></p>
<p t="844560" d="5719" w="1"><s ac="0">say a few words. Thank you.
Thank you,</s></p>
<p t="854959" d="8320" w="1"><s ac="0">Mr. President, thank you for seeing us.
30 years ago, my daughter Paulie was</s></p>
<p t="860480" d="7039" w="1"><s ac="0">brutally taken from our family. A jury
heard the evidence, convicted her</s></p>
<p t="865279" d="7360" w="1"><s ac="0">killer, and imposed the strongest
sentence allowed under California law.</s></p>
<p t="870639" d="7361" w="1"><s ac="0">For three decades, our family lived with
the understanding that the justice</s></p>
<p t="874720" d="10320" w="1"><s ac="0">system&#39;s decision would stand.
Today I stand before you outraged,</s></p>
<p t="882000" d="9760" w="1"><s ac="0">outraged that Governor Gavin Nuome
unilaterally erased that sentence and</s></p>
<p t="888000" d="9360" w="1"><s ac="0">547 more and commuted them to life
without parole without the consent of</s></p>
<p t="894160" d="8160" w="1"><s ac="0">victim&#39;s families or the people of
California.</s></p>
<p t="899440" d="8959" w="1"><s ac="0">This decision was not made by a jury. It
was not approved by the voters.</s></p>
<p t="904959" d="7041" w="1"><s ac="0">It was made by one politician acting
alone.</s></p>
<p t="910000" d="7360" w="1"><s ac="0">While nothing can bring Polly back, her
life mattered. The pain inflicted on our</s></p>
<p t="914959" d="7921" w="1"><s ac="0">family was real and the pursuit of
justice should not become a political</s></p>
<p t="919839" d="8800" w="1"><s ac="0">exercise. I am here today to stand for
Paulie, for victim&#39;s families across</s></p>
<p t="925680" d="8800" w="1"><s ac="0">California and for accountability in our
justice system. This is about more than</s></p>
<p t="931600" d="7919" w="1"><s ac="0">my family. This is about whether the
voices of crime victims matter. It&#39;s</s></p>
<p t="937440" d="7040" w="1"><s ac="0">about whether one politician should have
the power to nullify the decisions of</s></p>
<p t="941519" d="9281" w="1"><s ac="0">judges, juries, and the citizens who
enacted these laws.</s></p>
<p t="947360" d="8320" w="1"><s ac="0">All to advance a political agenda. Mr.
President, thank you for hearing us.</s></p>
<p t="953199" d="5481" w="1"><s ac="0">Thank you for seeing us. Thank you very
much.</s></p>
<p t="970240" d="10880" w="1"><s ac="0">Mark went through, as you just heard, 30
years. 30 years. At the end of all of</s></p>
<p t="977360" d="9440" w="1"><s ac="0">that drama, it was just wiped out. It&#39;s
probably just a political moment. So, I</s></p>
<p t="984399" d="6961" w="1"><s ac="0">want to thank you, Mark, and
uh just incredible what you&#39;ve had to</s></p>
<p t="989360" d="5919" w="1"><s ac="0">endure. I saw your case. I watched it. I
watched you very closely the other day</s></p>
<p t="993519" d="7281" w="1"><s ac="0">in an interview. I said, &quot;Boy, that&#39;s
tough. That&#39;s tough.&quot;</s></p>
<p t="998720" d="9119" w="1"><s ac="0">The murders of these precious children
are the worst nightmare of every mom and</s></p>
<p t="1004320" d="8400" w="1"><s ac="0">dad in America. Yet Gavin Newsome and
the radical left look at these heinous</s></p>
<p t="1010000" d="7120" w="1"><s ac="0">acts and their sympathy is not for the
children and their parents, but for the</s></p>
<p t="1014399" d="8161" w="1"><s ac="0">monsters who extinguished innocent young
lives. Don&#39;t understand it. Never did.</s></p>
<p t="1020800" d="8560" w="1"><s ac="0">I&#39;ve seen it so much and I never
understood it. And a lot of the media is</s></p>
