too easy to be with. I say he probably</s></p>
<p t="1986559" d="7441" w="1"><s ac="0">is. He&#39;s a great man. He&#39;s going to be
He&#39;s going to go down as a great man.</s></p>
<p t="1991519" d="6400" w="1"><s ac="0">Last year, there were more than 3,000
fewer murders than before I took office.</s></p>
<p t="1996320" d="5760" w="1"><s ac="0">That&#39;s a big statement. Federal law
