<p t="2004080" d="8560" w="1"><s ac="0">Violent crime arrests are up 90%.
And we deployed the National Guard to</s></p>
<p t="2010000" d="7840" w="1"><s ac="0">restore law and order to Memphis, New
Orleans, Washington DC, and crime is</s></p>
<p t="2015120" d="7600" w="1"><s ac="0">down more than 80%.
Think of it in Washington DC. Every day</s></p>
<p t="2020880" d="6240" w="1"><s ac="0">I come to the office, somebody thanking
