<p t="2171200" d="6720" w="1"><s ac="0">Today, I&#39;m announcing several major new
actions to continue our progress</s></p>
<p t="2175920" d="7040" w="1"><s ac="0">combating violent crime and to ensure
that the worst of the worst criminals</s></p>
<p t="2180240" d="7440" w="1"><s ac="0">are met with the retribution and
punishment they deserve. You know, we&#39;ve</s></p>
<p t="2184800" d="6720" w="1"><s ac="0">gone 18 months now without one, it&#39;s
hard to believe actually, it almost I&#39;d</s></p>
<p t="2189760" d="5839" w="1"><s ac="0">rather say a few got in because it
sounds more believable, but this is a</s></p>
<p t="2193280" d="7760" w="1"><s ac="0">fact made by not us, but by other
people. Not one person came through our</s></p>
<p t="2198320" d="7680" w="1"><s ac="0">southern border. Paul, not one for 18
months, but one illegal alien, as we</s></p>
<p t="2203599" d="6881" w="1"><s ac="0">say, and that&#39;s a record that probably
will never be broken, but we&#39;ll keep it</s></p>
<p t="2207760" d="7040" w="1"><s ac="0">going as long as we can. Already, the
caravans have started, but we&#39;re not</s></p>
<p t="2212240" d="7440" w="1"><s ac="0">letting them up, and Mexico better not
let them up either. First, in a few</s></p>
<p t="2217040" d="6799" w="1"><s ac="0">moments, I will sign a presidential
directive ordering the Department of</s></p>
<p t="2221760" d="6720" w="1"><s ac="0">Justice to seek the death penalty for
child murderers as well as rapists and</s></p>
<p t="2226800" d="6240" w="1"><s ac="0">human traffickers who kill their
victims. My order also directs the</s></p>
<p t="2231119" d="6561" w="1"><s ac="0">attorney general to expedite the
execution of federal death sentences.</s></p>
<p t="2235760" d="7520" w="1"><s ac="0">Once juries have spoken, capital
punishment will be swift and certain.</s></p>
<p t="2241359" d="6480" w="1"><s ac="0">I&#39;m also directing the Department of
Housing and Urban Development to compel</s></p>
<p t="2245440" d="7679" w="1"><s ac="0">public housing authorities to strengthen
tenant screenings and make it easier to</s></p>
<p t="2250480" d="7200" w="1"><s ac="0">remove problematic tenants, of which
people know who they are. Law-ab-bing</s></p>
<p t="2255520" d="7280" w="1"><s ac="0">families in need should not be forced to
live beside dangerous criminals turning</s></p>
<p t="2260400" d="8160" w="1"><s ac="0">affordable housing into dens of violence
and crime and horrible, horrible way to</s></p>
<p t="2266160" d="8400" w="1"><s ac="0">live. In addition, today I&#39;m announcing
that the Department of Justice will</s></p>
<p t="2270320" d="8960" w="1"><s ac="0">award nearly $150 million to new public
safety grants to help hire more than</s></p>
<p t="2276800" d="8640" w="1"><s ac="0">1,000 additional sworn law enforcement
officers and speed up response times to</s></p>
<p t="2283040" d="8280" w="1"><s ac="0">reports of domestic violence and sexual
assault nationwide.</s></p>
<p t="2288079" d="3241" w="1"><s ac="0">Thank you.</s></p>
<p t="2292960" d="7440" w="1"><s ac="0">Thank you very much.
And finally, at my request, Congressman</s></p>
<p t="2297920" d="6960" w="1"><s ac="0">Brandon Gil has just introduced a new
bill to strengthen the death penalty in</s></p>
<p t="2302720" d="6560" w="1"><s ac="0">America. And it&#39;s going to be much
different than it was in the past. Uh</s></p>
<p t="2307440" d="9520" w="1"><s ac="0">it&#39;s going to be strong. It&#39;s going to
be swift. The Just Punishment for Murder</s></p>
<p t="2313119" d="8480" w="1"><s ac="0">Act will codify many aspects of today&#39;s
