<p t="2332880" d="6199" w="1"><s ac="0">will sign it, Brandon, very, very
quickly. Okay. Thank you very much.</s></p>
<p t="2340160" d="8000" w="1"><s ac="0">And the ultimate
crimes deserve the ultimate punishment.</s></p>
<p t="2345119" d="8081" w="1"><s ac="0">This age-old wisdom has been a principle
